# Production: the client is on Vercel and the API is on Render (different origins).
# Set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel project's Environment Variables to your Render URL,
# e.g. https://nexus-api.onrender.com/api — that value overrides this file at build time.
VITE_API_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE.onrender.com/api
